  - text: a free namepoint adds the full intel (semantic recall, smart-merge)
    id: namepoint
    type: reference
    priority: standard
    timestamp: '2026-05-22T03:30:00Z'
  - text: 'install leads with uv: `uvx claude-fafm-sdk init`'
    id: install
    type: reference
    priority: standard
    timestamp: '2026-05-22T03:30:00Z'
  - text: one format, never a fork — fafm-engine and grok-faf-voice read the same soul
    id: interop
    type: project
    priority: high
